guide polestar-completionist-alliance/raid-naxxramas
title Naxxramas (Completionist)
faction Alliance
category Dungeons
levels 60-60
zone Eastern Plaguelands
pitch Naxxramas, in Eastern Plaguelands. A raid.
why Every Alliance quest of Naxxramas: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

step Getting there
  note The entrance is in Eastern Plaguelands: the arrow leads to it. This is a raid: it needs a raid group.

